# Architecture

- One codebase for all brands. Brand differences are config + themes, never app forks.
- Apps are composition roots. Packages never import from `apps/*`.
- Prisma only in `@mysimcha/database`. Stripe → `@mysimcha/payments`. Cloudinary → `@mysimcha/media`. Twilio → `@mysimcha/notifications`. OpenAI → `@mysimcha/ai`. Maps → `@mysimcha/maps`.
- Tenant data access always includes `organizationId`. Never trust client-sent roles.
- Prefer Server Components. Client Components only for interactivity.
- Before changing auth, tenancy, or billing architecture, ask for approval.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — Prisma in an app
import { PrismaClient } from "@prisma/client";

// ✅ GOOD
import { findMembership } from "@mysimcha/database";
```
